---
---
<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div data-reveal class="card">
      <div class="left">
        <div class="ring"><img src="/images/founder.png" alt="Jarod Taylor, Founder of Taylor Talent Partners" /></div>
        <div class="name">Jarod Taylor</div>
        <div class="role">Founder</div>
      </div>
      <div class="right">
        <div class="eyebrow">Meet Jarod</div>
        <p class="lead">Ten years across technical, legal, and executive search — including in-house recruiting at Apple, Google, and Indeed, with C-suite search experience at Checkr and Talentful.</p>
        <p class="bio">Most recently a Senior Talent Partner embedded with founders and executive teams at startups, scale-ups, and global enterprises — aligning hiring strategy to growth plans rather than filling reqs. AI-enabled sourcing, structured interview design, and one point of contact from intake to signed offer.</p>
        <div class="cols">
          <div><div class="label">In-house</div><div class="items">Apple · Google<br />Indeed</div></div>
          <div><div class="label">Agency-side</div><div class="items">GLG · Checkr<br />DISCO · Talentful</div></div>
          <div><div class="label">Functions</div><div class="items">GTM · Product · CS<br />G&amp;A · Legal</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .band { background: var(--bg-elevated); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .wrap { max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(72px, 10vw, 128px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 48px); }
  .card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr; gap: 64px; align-items: start; }
  .left { text-align: center; }
  .ring { width: 200px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto 24px; border-radius: 24px; padding: 3px; background: var(--gradient-accent); }
  .ring img { width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 22px; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  .name { font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 20px; }
  .role { font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--accent-solid); margin-top: 6px; }
  .eyebrow { font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-tertiary); margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .lead { font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(20px, 2.6vw, 27px); line-height: 1.4; letter-spacing: -.01em; margin: 0 0 22px; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .bio { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.68; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0 0 32px; max-width: 62ch; }
  .cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: var(--border); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; }
  .cols > div { background: var(--bg); padding: 18px 20px; }
  .label { font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace; font-size: 10.5px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-tertiary); margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .items { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .wrap { padding: 64px 20px; }
    .card { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 44px; }
    .ring { width: min(200px, 62vw); height: min(200px, 62vw); }
    .right { min-width: 0; }
    .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center; }
    .lead { font-size: 21px; line-height: 1.4; }
    .bio { font-size: 14px; }
    .cols { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 1px; }
    .cols > div { padding: 16px 18px; }
    .items br { display: none; }
  }
</style>
